2026-07-27T08:58:55.8057529Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8058476Z i /tmp/RtmpfuBZmt/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8058877Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8059347Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8060085Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8060725Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8061679Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:58:55.8062409Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
